
build
    Execute default build target, if a target not specified, and it does not publish to repo,
    unless you build "publish" target

    Without workspaces:
        $ viator build
        $ viator build [target]+feat,feat2,feat3,armv9-support,example-arch-ext
    With workspaces:
        $ viator build :subproj
        $ viator build :subproj:target

    W/o interactive terminal: (w/o color)

